equality of cochains on the level-`K` local group `decomp k B ⊓ K.fixingSubgroup`.  The old
full-level form demanded instead that the level-`K` datum extend to a cocycle on the whole local
group `decomp k B`, i.e. that the local class of the datum lie in the image of the restriction
