clause 3 outside `K.fixingSubgroup`: `IsYRealisation.locAgree`, `.locAgree_conj`,
`.zStatementHypotheses` and `IsZData.split` (its `hag₂`) all apply it only at arguments in
`K.fixingSubgroup`.

